WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.685 --> 00:00:04.161
- Okay, new strategy,
don't ruin it too much.

00:00:04.881 --> 00:00:08.219
(bouncy pop music)

00:00:09.176 --> 00:00:11.765
- I am gonna be cutting
Steve's hair today.

00:00:11.765 --> 00:00:14.875
- I am nervous that I'm gonna
cut too much of his hair off

00:00:14.875 --> 00:00:16.280
and he's gonna be mad at me.

00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:24.016
- (Jennifer) A short, Jake
Gyllenhaal-type style.

00:00:24.019 --> 00:00:24.975
- (Safiya) This is what I picked out

00:00:24.975 --> 00:00:26.715
for Tyler's ideal haircut.

00:00:26.715 --> 00:00:28.013
I think we can pull this off.

00:00:28.013 --> 00:00:30.708
- I am pretty, like,
particular about my hair.

00:00:30.708 --> 00:00:31.791
- You're very particular about your hair.

00:00:31.791 --> 00:00:32.527
- I get pretty stressed out.

00:00:32.527 --> 00:00:33.982
I've been going to the same barber now

00:00:33.982 --> 00:00:34.952
for about three years.

00:00:34.952 --> 00:00:36.789
- As long as it doesn't
look like complete (bleep),

00:00:36.789 --> 00:00:38.681
then I'll be okay with it.

00:00:38.681 --> 00:00:39.772
Plus, I've got a couple of new hats

00:00:39.772 --> 00:00:40.976
I'm looking forward to wearing.

00:00:40.976 --> 00:00:42.442
- I'm not gonna get mad at her.

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:44.201
Unless she does a bad job.

00:00:47.206 --> 00:00:50.791
(techno pop)

00:00:52.086 --> 00:00:53.968
- Focus, all right, Jen?

00:00:53.968 --> 00:00:56.327
- You gotta pick it up and then cut.

00:00:56.327 --> 00:00:57.167
- No, I cut like this.

00:00:57.167 --> 00:01:00.739
- No! No, you gotta pick
it up and then cut, okay?

00:01:00.739 --> 00:01:02.480
You don't just shoot in there.

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:04.106
It's not an arts and crafts project.

00:01:04.106 --> 00:01:07.023
- I feel like if I were to
pursue a different career

00:01:07.023 --> 00:01:08.122
I could do hair.

00:01:08.122 --> 00:01:09.889
- I'm glad that you feel
so casual about this.

00:01:09.889 --> 00:01:11.737
(Jennifer laughs)

00:01:11.737 --> 00:01:13.929
- Okay, babe, are you ready for the swoop?

00:01:13.929 --> 00:01:15.086
- Oh, no no, hold on, hold on.

00:01:15.086 --> 00:01:16.292
We really gotta game plan this one.

00:01:16.292 --> 00:01:16.836
This is what you're gonna do.

00:01:16.836 --> 00:01:18.522
You're gonna get the fingers out

00:01:18.522 --> 00:01:20.022
and then you're gonna slice there.

00:01:20.022 --> 00:01:21.290
- I feel like you've been
spending a little bit

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:23.610
too much time on the left
side, is that just me?

00:01:23.610 --> 00:01:25.931
I don't know! I shouldn't
be directing you.

00:01:25.931 --> 00:01:27.743
You're the one who can
see what's going on.

00:01:27.743 --> 00:01:28.718
- You're right, I haven't
been this stressed

00:01:28.718 --> 00:01:30.482
to get a haircut since I was three.

00:01:30.482 --> 00:01:32.711
- Well, she stopped laughing, so ...

00:01:32.711 --> 00:01:34.430
that's either good or bad.

00:01:34.430 --> 00:01:35.971
- I love you, babe.

00:01:35.971 --> 00:01:37.471
- I love you so much.
- (Tyler) Positive thoughts.

00:01:37.471 --> 00:01:39.793
- I love you, too,
okay? Positive thoughts.

00:01:39.793 --> 00:01:42.835
- One last look on this side. (laughs)

00:01:42.835 --> 00:01:44.901
- Is it, oh, my God.

00:01:44.901 --> 00:01:49.732
(buzzing)

00:01:49.732 --> 00:01:53.232
- There's just like one
small bald spot. (laughs)

00:01:53.232 --> 00:01:55.809
- No, there's not. There
is not a bald spot.

00:01:55.809 --> 00:01:56.574
(Jennifer laughs)

00:01:57.594 --> 00:01:59.171
- Oh, shit.

00:02:00.221 --> 00:02:02.079
It's fine! Nothing happened!

00:02:02.079 --> 00:02:04.796
So you know how surgeons
are trained, to like,

00:02:04.796 --> 00:02:06.958
when they mess up, say "There"?

00:02:06.958 --> 00:02:08.417
I'm just gonna start doing that. (laughs)

00:02:08.417 --> 00:02:10.507
- You look good. (laughs)

00:02:10.507 --> 00:02:13.301
- You know, you've said
I look good way too much

00:02:13.301 --> 00:02:15.786
for me to believe that you
actually feel that way.

00:02:16.746 --> 00:02:18.259
- Yeah, I think I'm done.

00:02:18.263 --> 00:02:22.167
- This is the Jake Gyllenhaal,
courtesy of yours truly.

00:02:27.216 --> 00:02:29.259
- Okay, it's not, eh, okay.

00:02:30.429 --> 00:02:32.421
- It's not that bad.
- (Jennifer) It's pretty good!

00:02:34.041 --> 00:02:36.403
(Tyler laughs)

00:02:37.573 --> 00:02:40.073
- Um ...

00:02:40.073 --> 00:02:41.473
That's not bad!

00:02:41.473 --> 00:02:44.850
- I was expecting so
much worse, so, good job.

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:46.359
- Thank you, thanks.

00:02:46.359 --> 00:02:47.623
- It's actually kind of dopey.

00:02:47.623 --> 00:02:50.367
I mean, like, the sides,
it's not very good.

00:02:50.367 --> 00:02:51.189
- Okay, fine.

00:02:51.189 --> 00:02:52.778
- But, it's not ...

00:02:52.778 --> 00:02:53.796
- What's ...

00:02:54.516 --> 00:02:59.516
(pop music)

00:03:01.616 --> 00:03:03.976
- I don't think I should
ever cut his hair ever again.

00:03:03.976 --> 00:03:07.458
It's too stressful, and
if I had done any worse

00:03:07.458 --> 00:03:08.984
I think we would've gotten into a fight.

00:03:08.984 --> 00:03:11.568
- Would I let you cut my hair again?

00:03:11.568 --> 00:03:15.074
Let's just say not in the next long time.

00:03:15.964 --> 00:03:16.854
- Fair.

00:03:19.714 --> 00:03:21.107
- I look like one of
those kids who just got

00:03:21.107 --> 00:03:22.547
bubble gum stuck in his
hair and they're just like,

00:03:22.547 --> 00:03:25.035
"We gotta get it out any
way possible," you know?

00:03:25.035 --> 00:03:26.010
- What do you mean, on this side?

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:27.021
- Yeah, but I think it looks cool.

00:03:27.021 --> 00:03:27.911
I mean, I'll grow into it.

